   "subject": "Re: Can I vary gradient colors based on another variable in a heatmap?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Sounds like you want to use two color scales. That&#39;s not possible. <div><br></div><div>Is there a way you can create a new variable between the two you want your color based upon to determine color? You could set one as an alpha scale and use M_WE as a color? That way intensity of color could be linked to one scale and the other variable is the color? </div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
