     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Apparently, the answer is here:<br><br><a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/24822621/multiple-legends-in-a-plot-with-geom-tile\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/24822621/multiple-legends-in-a-plot-with-geom-tile&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792368561400000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3RLp9ITmivjni6zVBuqp-I\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/24822621/multiple-legends-in-a-plot-with-geom-tile </a><br><br>Brandon, it seems very similar to what you suggested.<br><br>Thanks,<br>Dustin <br></div>"
